**BROWSER MAY SHOW A WARNING – THIS IS STANDARD**

When downloading this training software, Chrome, Edge, Firefox may display:

• "This file is not commonly downloaded"
• "Chromium cannot verify the download safety"
• "This file type can harm your computer"

**WHY THIS HAPPENS:**

Specialized chess training tools have smaller user bases than mainstream applications, triggering generic browser warnings based on download volume algorithms. This is an automated safety protocol, not a malware detection.

