## TRAINING MODULES

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

**▸ TACTICAL CALCULATION**
Forced sequences, checks, captures, and threats. Practice recognizing tactical patterns and calculating variations accurately.

**▸ ENDGAME PRECISION**
Master critical endgame positions where precise calculation determines win, loss, or draw. Includes tablebase-verified solutions.

**▸ OPENING PREPARATION**
Calculate deep opening variations and learn to navigate sharp theoretical lines with confidence.

**▸ POSITIONAL JUDGMENT**
Evaluate complex middlegame positions and compare your assessments with engine analysis.

**▸ BLITZ TRAINING**
Race against the clock with rapid-fire calculation exercises to build intuition and speed.

**▸ CUSTOM POSITIONS**
Import your own games or positions for targeted practice on specific weaknesses.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

---

## KEY FEATURES

✦ **Progressive Difficulty** – 10 levels from beginner (800 ELO) to grandmaster (2500+ ELO)

✦ **Move-by-Move Feedback** – See exactly where your calculation diverged from optimal play

✦ **Variation Tree Display** – Visual representation of calculated branches and missed lines

✦ **Timer Controls** – Practice with classical, rapid, or blitz time controls

✦ **Accuracy Scoring** – Get percentage scores for each exercise and track improvement over time

✦ **Mistake Analysis** – Identify recurring calculation errors (oversights, tunnel vision, misevaluations)

✦ **Hint System** – Progressive hints that guide without revealing full solution

✦ **Bookmark Positions** – Save challenging positions for repeat practice

✦ **Progress Tracking** – Detailed statistics and performance graphs

✦ **Custom Training Plans** – Create structured improvement programs

